{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_017.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_sub_017.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_01",
      "hash64": "C22C7AA9C24788E6",
      "text": "嘿，小伙子。\\n你的宝可梦看上去很强嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_02",
      "hash64": "C22C79A9C2478733",
      "text": "嘿，小姑娘。\\n你的宝可梦看上去很强嘛。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_03",
      "hash64": "C22C78A9C2478580",
      "text": "你说不定能\\n打倒北上鬼面组。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_select_01",
      "hash64": "F6C6711E164DEA1A",
      "text": "北上鬼面组？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_select_02",
      "hash64": "F6C6701E164DE867",
      "text": "什么来头？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_04",
      "hash64": "C22C7FA9C2479165",
      "text": "北上鬼面组是\\n出没于村子之外，\\r\\n戴着鬼面具的强大训练家。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_05",
      "hash64": "C22C7EA9C2478FB2",
      "text": "那些家伙最喜欢厉害的孩子，\\n一直满心期待着别人来挑战哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_06",
      "hash64": "C22C7DA9C2478DFF",
      "text": "根据传闻，\\n北上鬼面组由７个人组成……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_07",
      "hash64": "C22C7CA9C2478C4C",
      "text": "如果你想挑战他们，可得小心哦。\\n那群家伙可不是好对付的。\\r\\n你每打赢一个人，我都会送你好东西哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_08",
      "hash64": "C22C83A9C2479831",
      "text": "我听说有关你的事情了哦。\\n看来你打赢鬼面组了啊。\\r\\n那我就按照约定送你好东西吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_09",
      "hash64": "C22C82A9C247967E",
      "text": "我听说有关你的事情了哦。\\n看来你打赢鬼面组了啊。\\r\\n那我就按照约定送你好东西吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_10",
      "hash64": "C22975A9C2454A90",
      "text": "鬼面组只剩下１个人了……\\n需要提示你那个人在哪里吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_11",
      "hash64": "C22976A9C2454C43",
      "text": "鬼面组还剩下[VAR 0x0200(0001)]个人……\\n需要提示你他们在哪里吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_01",
      "hash64": "36833974D91DF465",
      "text": "自鬼山往青之方位，\\n竹林之中，吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_02",
      "hash64": "36833674D91DEF4C",
      "text": "自远方能瞭望鬼角之地，\\n吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_03",
      "hash64": "36833774D91DF0FF",
      "text": "自鬼口流出之水，\\n其近旁缝隙处，吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_04",
      "hash64": "36833474D91DEBE6",
      "text": "地狱或乐土，\\n二者皆可选之池畔，吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_05",
      "hash64": "36833574D91DED99",
      "text": "远离痛苦之土地，\\n奇岩荒野，吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_06",
      "hash64": "36833274D91DE880",
      "text": "鬼角有长有短，\\n非长一侧，吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_07",
      "hash64": "36833374D91DEA33",
      "text": "不夜池旁有洞穴，\\n落入其中，吾之所在。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_12",
      "hash64": "C22977A9C2454DF6",
      "text": "这样一来……你似乎就\\n将鬼面组的人全都打倒了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_13",
      "hash64": "C22978A9C2454FA9",
      "text": "遇到你这么厉害的家伙，\\n看来我终于能拿出真本事了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_14",
      "hash64": "C22979A9C245515C",
      "text": "哈！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_15",
      "hash64": "C2297AA9C245530F",
      "text": "鄙人乃独一无二的\\n幕后北上鬼面组……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_16",
      "hash64": "C2297BA9C24554C2",
      "text": "最终对决即将展开，\\n待你准备万全，\\r\\n便来告知鄙人吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_17",
      "hash64": "C2297CA9C2455675",
      "text": "与鄙人的最终对决……\\n你做好完全准备了吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_18",
      "hash64": "C2297DA9C2455828",
      "text": "……待你备好再来。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_30",
      "hash64": "C23001A9C24AA422",
      "text": "需移至适合对决之处。\\n……随鄙人来。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_19",
      "hash64": "C2297EA9C24559DB",
      "text": "幕后北上鬼面组——村正！\\n鄙人……来也！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_20",
      "hash64": "C23387A9C24DBDAB",
      "text": "哈、哈、哈！\\n没想到连鄙人都被你打败了！\\r\\n你配得上鄙人的称赞！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_21",
      "hash64": "C23386A9C24DBBF8",
      "text": "……………………\\n……………………",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_22",
      "hash64": "C23389A9C24DC111",
      "text": "……开玩笑的！\\n辛苦你了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_23",
      "hash64": "C23388A9C24DBF5E",
      "text": "你刚刚体验的是鬼面组活动！\\n是一场能让小孩子锻炼腰腿，\\r\\n了解对战乐趣的活动哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_24",
      "hash64": "C2338BA9C24DC477",
      "text": "虽然每年都会在掩面祭期间\\n举行这场活动……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_25",
      "hash64": "C2338AA9C24DC2C4",
      "text": "但工作人员都不懂得手下留情，\\n从来没有小孩能够通关！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_26",
      "hash64": "C2338DA9C24DC7DD",
      "text": "连我都打败的人，\\n你大概还是第一个呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_27",
      "hash64": "C2338CA9C24DC62A",
      "text": "所以恭喜你！\\n奖品赏给你了！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_28",
      "hash64": "C2337FA9C24DB013",
      "text": "希望你今后也能在北上的大自然中\\n继续成长，变得更强啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_29",
      "hash64": "C2337EA9C24DAE60",
      "text": "哦哦，强大的孩子啊！\\n你来见鄙人啦！\\r\\n哈、哈、哈，乐哉乐哉！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
